### 1. Signup as a GALLERY account (allowed, 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new-gallery3@test.com",
  "password": "Password1234!",
  "userRole": "gallery",
  "galleryName": "new test gallery"
}


### 2. Signup as a COLLECTOR account (allowed, 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new-collector@test.com",
  "password": "Password1234!",
  "userRole": "collector"
