### 3. Signup as an ADMIN account (blocked  401 Unauthorized, only an admin can create admins)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new-admin@test.com",
  "password": "Password1234!",
  "userRole": "admin"
}


### 4. Signup as an ARTIST account (blocked 401 Unauthorized, only a gallery can add artists)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new-artist@test.com",
  "password": "Password1234!",
  "userRole": "artiste"
}


### 5. Signup with an already existing account (409 Conflict expected)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new-gallery@test.com",
  "password": "Password1234!",
  "userRole": "gallery"
}


